---
import Container from './Container.astro';
---

<section id="summary" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
  <Container>
    <h2 data-reveal class="font-heading text-6xl font-bold text-coral md:text-[80px]">
      Summary
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white">
      <p data-reveal>
       Based at Localsearch on the Gold Coast, I maintained client websites at scale — handling everything from DNS configuration and go-live deployment through to responsive fixes, SEO redirects, and cross-browser QA.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal>
        What sets me apart is a willingness to go beyond the brief: I've contributed to creative redesigns, built a GSAP animation prototype that showcased animation possibilities which made it into production, and regularly act as a technical escalation point across design and development.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal>
        Backed by an 800-hour full-stack bootcamp, and proficient in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Tailwind, Figma, and the full Duda CMS workflow.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>